          "PF_LL_stats",
          "PF_LL_hearts",
          "PF_LL_family",
          "PF_LL_home",
          "PF_LL_reset"
        ],
        "names": [
          "Care: I'm cold (care check now)",
          "Fire: light a campfire 3 tiles east",
          "Fire: start tonight's evening now (ignores the clock)",
          "Fire: advance the evening one tick (as if 20 minutes passed)",
          "Watch: I fall asleep",
          "Watch: I wake up",
          "Friction: give everyone within 10 tiles gallows humor",
          "Friction: I throw up",
          "Witness: I nearly die (in front of everyone)",
          "Wounds: I'm bitten and bleeding (tend check now)",
          "Fire: run the evening beat now",
          "Fire: the next activity is a carving with a keepsake",
          "Waste: I quick-butcher a corpse (signal)",
          "Waste: give everyone within 10 tiles 'hates waste'",
          "Combat: the nearest person kills the thing on me",
          "Combat: I kill the thing on the nearest person",
          "Combat: I kill something",
          "Social: every band spends 10 evenings together (off-screen camp)",
          "Social: the nearest band member (not a leader, not a child) dies",
          "Romance: the nearest person falls for you (attraction 65)",
          "Romance: two nearby adults fall for each other",
          "Stats: what has happened so far",
          "Hearts lab (v0.2): couples, jealousy, burial",
          "Family lab (v0.3): pregnancy, babies, growing up, orphans",
          "Home lab (v0.4): evenings at home, breakfast, residents, the world",
          "Reset all cooldowns"
        ],
        "descriptions": [
          "Gives you the cold effect and runs the care check immediately.",
          "Builds a fire ring 3 tiles east of you, clears the grass around it, and lights it.",
          "Resets tonight's evening and advances it once: people sit down if it's calm.",
          "One evening tick: scatter if there's trouble, sit back down if it's calm again, or run the evening if people have been seated long enough.",
          "Runs the falling-asleep signal (someone takes the watch).",
          "Runs the waking signal (the watcher's night counts).",
          "So the tease test has a teaser.",
          "Runs the throw-up signal for you (someone with gallows humor teases you).",
          "Reports a near_death moment of strength 70; everyone who can see you remembers it.",
          "Bites and bleeds you a little, then runs the wound check (needs no hostiles within 15 tiles).",
          "Runs the evening itself immediately (no threat check).",
          "The first person to do something at the next evening whittles, and the carving is for you.",
          "Runs the butchery signal as if you quick-butchered something.  Needs someone who hates waste nearby.",
          "So the waste test has a witness.",
          "You're hurt; the nearest NPC (within 5 tiles) kills something next to you.  Tests shared danger and being saved (with the running score).",
          "The nearest NPC (within 5 tiles) is hurt and you kill something next to them.  Tests you saving them, and the running score.",
          "Runs the kill signal with you as the killer.  Everyone within 8 tiles shares the danger.",
          "Runs the off-screen band evening 10 times for every band in the roster, wherever it is, ignoring the clock.  Then check a band member's views in the People menu.",
          "Kills the nearest adult A-Life band member within 10 tiles, so you can see who grieves and hear them speak of it at the fire.",
          "Sets the nearest NPC's attraction and warmth toward you high enough to confess at the next fire, if their nature allows it.  Shows their romantic nature.",
          "The two nearest adult NPCs within 10 tiles get attraction 65 and warmth 40 toward each other, so one may confess at the next fire.",
          "Counters from the whole run: moments, memories, off-screen band camps and hunts, couples, rejections, grief.",
          "Opens the v0.2 test menu.",
          "Opens the v0.3 test menu.",
          "Opens the v0.4 test menu.",
          "Care, tease, meal, near-death and tonight's fire."
        ],
        "keys": [
          "a",
          "b",
          "c",
          "d",
          "e",
          "f",
          "g",
          "h",
          "i",
          "j",
          "k",
